WEBVTT

00:08:27.836 --> 00:08:31.173
The Alliance is not only ready
to meet this moment,

00:08:31.173 --> 00:08:34.134
we're ready to create
a foundation so strong,

00:08:34.176 --> 00:08:36.971
that we can make it another 200 years.

00:08:36.971 --> 00:08:38.138
Together.

00:08:38.722 --> 00:08:39.890
Thank you.

00:08:39.932 --> 00:08:45.980
(Applause and cheers)